-- en: "DBM-Core for Retail, Forever, Classic Era, TBC and Mists Classic. Encounter timers need the matching raid or dungeon module download, such as DBM-Raids-BC for TBC raids."
L["DBM-Core for Retail, Forever, Classic Era, TBC and Mists Classic. Encounter timers need the matching raid or dungeon module download, such as DBM-Raids-BC for TBC raids."] = "Retail, Forever, Classic Era, TBC, Mists Classic용 DBM-Core입니다. 우두머리 전투 타이머에는 TBC 공격대용 DBM-Raids-BC처럼 해당 공격대나 던전 모듈을 내려받아야 합니다."
